sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant MCP as MCP Server :9000
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB
    participant SHA as SHAStore
    participant Ollama as Ollama gpt-oss:20b

    Dev->>MCP: generate_skills_pkg { target_path, force: false }

    MCP->>Chroma: skills_cache_guard get_indexed_repo_metadata limit=1 no embedding cost
    Chroma-->>MCP: { repo_url, branch, commit_sha: def456 }

    MCP->>SHA: get_skills_entry repo_url + branch
    SHA-->>MCP: { skills_sha: abc123, skills_path }

    Note over MCP: stored skills_sha abc123 != commit_sha def456, cache miss

    par Three targeted ChromaDB queries
        MCP->>Chroma: Logic chunks n=500 ranked by symbol density
        MCP->>Chroma: Config chunks n=50
        MCP->>Chroma: Interface chunks n=50
    end

    Chroma-->>MCP: SkillsData { logic_chunks top 20, pattern_summaries 20, file_manifest 100, identifier_index 100x5 }

    MCP->>Ollama: skills_synthesizer temp=0.2 num_predict=4096 num_ctx=16384 6-section prompt
    Ollama-->>MCP: PROJECT_SKILLS.md content

    MCP->>MCP: file_exporter validate target_path within SKILLS_EXPORT_DIR
    MCP->>MCP: write PROJECT_SKILLS.md

    MCP->>SHA: set_skills_sha get-merge-update preserves commit_sha
    MCP-->>Dev: { path, bytes_written: 8420 }

    Note over Dev: Second call same corpus: cache_hit = true, under 2s, no LLM call
